      "role": "user",
      "content": "the silence waiting to hold me... thats a heavy way to put it. it just feels like i'm running on a treadmill that isnt even plugged in. like, why keep running when the destination doesn't even exist? if everything is just noise, why am i expected to keep fighting to stay part of it?",
